WEBVTT

00:00:28.849 --> 00:00:30.890
Ima emocije,

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:34.426
gnev i sreću.

00:00:34.426 --> 00:00:38.220
Ima sećanja,
kao što su scene iz vašeg detinjstva

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.920
koje se odigravaju pred vama.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:45.375
I ima taj stalni narativ

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:49.751
u vašem toku svesnog razmišljanja.

00:00:49.751 --> 00:00:54.824
U srcu ovog filma ste vi

00:00:54.824 --> 00:00:59.189
koji to direktno doživljavate.

00:00:59.189 --> 00:01:04.881
Ovaj film je vaš tok svesti,